    "['interface [interface_name] passive', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ospf 1', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent HUAWEI router configuration command for the Juniper OSPF passive interface configuration:\\n\\n##\\nospf 1\\n area 0.0.0.0\\n  network 1.1.1.1 0.0.0.0\\n  silent-interface LoopBack0\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- In HUAWEI devices:\\n  - \"ospf 1\" creates the OSPF process (similar to Juniper\\'s protocols ospf)\\n  - \"area 0.0.0.0\" specifies the OSPF area\\n  - \"network\" command advertises the loopback interface\\'s IP\\n  - \"silent-interface\" is the equivalent of Juniper\\'s \"passive\" interface command\\n- The loopback interface is specified by its name (LoopBack0) rather than the unit notation (lo0.0) used in Juniper', 'trans_template': 'ospf 1'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'area 0.0.0.0', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent HUAWEI router configuration command for the Juniper OSPF passive interface configuration:\\n\\n##\\nospf 1\\n area 0.0.0.0\\n  network 1.1.1.1 0.0.0.0\\n  silent-interface LoopBack0\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- In HUAWEI devices:\\n  - \"ospf 1\" creates the OSPF process (similar to Juniper\\'s protocols ospf)\\n  - \"area 0.0.0.0\" specifies the OSPF area\\n  - \"network\" command advertises the loopback interface\\'s IP\\n  - \"silent-interface\" is the equivalent of Juniper\\'s \"passive\" interface command\\n- The loopback interface is specified by its name (LoopBack0) rather than the unit notation (lo0.0) used in Juniper', 'trans_template': 'area 0.0.0.0'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'network 1.1.1.1 0.0.0.0', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent HUAWEI router configuration command for the Juniper OSPF passive interface configuration:\\n\\n##\\nospf 1\\n area 0.0.0.0\\n  network 1.1.1.1 0