    "['unit [unit_number] family [family_type]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'interface GigabitEthernet1/0/0.10', 'parent_command': ['interface [parameter1]'], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent HUAWEI command for the Juniper `set interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 10 family ccc` configuration:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet1/0/0.10\\n ccc\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. The Juniper command configures CCC (Circuit Cross Connect) encapsulation on sub-interface unit 10 of ge-1/0/0\\n2. In HUAWEI, this is translated by:\\n   - Creating the subinterface (GigabitEthernet1/0/0.10)\\n   - Enabling CCC encapsulation with the `ccc` command\\n3. Note that HUAWEI uses \"GigabitEthernet\" instead of \"ge\" for interface naming\\n4. The VLAN configuration (from other Juniper commands) would need to be configured separately in HUAWEI', 'trans_template': 'interface GigabitEthernet1/0/0.10'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ccc', 'parent_command': ['interface [parameter1]'], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent HUAWEI command for the Juniper `set interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 10 family ccc` configuration:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet1/0/0.10\\n ccc\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. The Juniper command configures CCC (Circuit Cross Connect) encapsulation on sub-interface unit 10 of ge-1/0/0\\n2. In HUAWEI, this is translated by:\\n   - Creating the subinterface (GigabitEthernet1/0/0.10)\\n   - Enabling CCC encapsulation with the `ccc` command\\n3. Note that HUAWEI uses \"GigabitEthernet\" instead of \"ge\" for interface naming\\n4. The VLAN configuration (from other Juniper commands) would need to be configured separately in HUAWEI', 'trans_template': 'ccc'}]]": 1,
